<title>SWEDEN: SWEDISH RIKSBANK SAYS CROWN UNDERVALUED.</title>
<headline>SWEDISH RIKSBANK SAYS CROWN UNDERVALUED.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lars Heikensten, deputy governor of the Swedish central bank, said on Thursday that the crown was undervalued and should appreciate and that he saw room for lower long bond yields.</p>
</text>
